# Build context of docker/Dockerfile.cpu (D11). The image copies pyproject.toml, uv.lock,
# README.md, vendor/, src/ and configs/ and nothing else, so everything below stays out of the
# context: the local environment, the history, the data and the models (large, and never part
# of an image), the tests, the documents and the tool caches. The vendored wheels in vendor/ are
# NOT excluded: uv.lock names them by path.
.git
.github
.venv
.env
.superpowers
.serena
.hypothesis
.mypy_cache
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
build
runs
data
models
tests
docs
